/**
 * This {@link UiSdlEpic epic} is designed to safeguard performance in the {@link UiSdlScatterPlot scatter plot}
 * chart by preventing rendering when {@link ReliabilityTransformUtil#isDataPointLimitExceeded} determines that
 * the number of {@link TimedDataPoint}s exceeds the defined performance limit.
 */
type ScatterPlotFilterPanelSubmitEpic mixes UiSdlEpic
